property_value: NCIT:P325 "A disease in which the body does not control the amount of glucose (a type of sugar) in the blood and the kidneys make a large amount of urine. This disease occurs when the body does not make enough insulin or does not use it the way it should." xsd:string {http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCIT_P378="NCI-GLOSS"}
